# Table data import into test WITH writing (UtkCst* test rows), then Restore data from the remembered work dir.
# Leaves test as it was. Needs the archive from data-export.keys (dev UtkCstSource) as the newest in data\.
wait:main menu
Down
Down
Down                  # Table data
Enter
Down                  # Import data
Enter
wait:stand list
Down                  # test
Enter
wait:archive list
Enter                 # newest data archive
wait:mode
Enter                 # insert
Enter                 # stop
wait:dry run + write question
Y
Enter                 # write
wait:written + pause
Enter
wait:table data menu
Down
Down                  # Restore data
Enter
wait:stand list
Enter                 # test (the last target comes first)
wait:work dirs (only backups made on test)
Enter                 # the import just made
wait:undo question
Y
Enter
wait:restored + pause
Enter
wait:table data menu
Down
Down
Down                  # ← Back
Enter
wait:main menu
Down
Down
Down
Down
Down                  # Quit
Enter